{"quest_id": 7901, "name": "意志を持った魔剣", "description": "呼び声を聞いて王座の間にやってきた\n王子たち。そこでは魔神セーレと意志を\n持った魔剣が言い争いをしていて！？\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "ランス１０００　交わる世界", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 320390, "map_no": 5155, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 72000, "attack": 1200, "base_hp": 72000, "base_attack": 1200, "damage_type": "true", "armor_defense": 800, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 77, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143232, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 64, "change_to": 1, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 35981, "global_id": 9598, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 9599, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 60}], "creates_obj": 6}, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "hp": 72000, "base_hp": 72000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 182, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143248, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1283, "master_id": 35982, "global_id": 9599}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_count": 2, "hp": 8800, "attack": 650, "base_hp": 8800, "base_attack": 650, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 48, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143104, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 35963, "global_id": 9580, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 43}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1500, "attack": 100, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 100, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2102912, "master_id": 404, "global_id": 403, "from_condition": 2, "spawned_on_death_by": [3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 2, "hp": 8000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 240, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 193, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143088, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 818, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "missile_id": 560, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "heal": true}, "master_id": 35961, "global_id": 9578, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 54}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 170, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 600.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143072, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 35960, "global_id": 9577, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 82}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 2, "hp": 9000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 68, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143152, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 35972, "global_id": 9589, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 98}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 2, "hp": 14000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 14000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 160, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 79, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143120, "special_effect_id": 1286, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 35973, "global_id": 9590, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 119}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 2, "hp": 10000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 600.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2143216, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1285, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 35974, "global_id": 9591, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 403, "spawn_sec": 206}], "popups": ["ランスに憑依した魔神セーレは\n特定のタイミングで\n特殊攻撃を行います。\n\n特殊攻撃が発動すると\n特定の近接マスに配置していた\nユニットは撤退します。\n撤退後は再出撃が可能です。", "サテラに変身した\nドッペルゲンガーの攻撃は、\n人間系の味方ユニットに対する\nダメージが10％アップします。\n\n\n\n　　　　　　(1/2)", "サテラに変身したドッペルゲンガーの\n攻撃を受けた味方ユニットは\n2秒間、防御力が減少します。\n\nこの効果は、状態異常に対する\nユニットの能力では\n軽減、無効化できません。\n　　　　　　(2/2)", "魔想志津香に変身した\nドッペルゲンガーは、\n一定範囲内の\nユニットの魔法耐性を\n20％ダウンさせます。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "――なんと強情な肉体だ……。\n我が魂を受け入れてなお、\nなんなのだ、この湧き上がる衝動は……。", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――それはだな。", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "なっ……この声は……。\nまさか、この剣か……！？", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "魔剣カオス", "text": "うむ。儂じゃ。\nその名も魔剣カオスである。\n異世界の魔神よ、面倒なやつに取り憑いたもんじゃなー。", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "意志ある魔剣を持つとは……。\nやはりこの肉体は、一級品の戦士であったか。", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "魔剣カオス", "text": "まぁ、一級品の戦士であることは否定せんがなー。\nしかしお前に持ち歩かれるのは気に入らん。", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "魔剣カオス", "text": "おーい！　ランスッ！\n近くまで来ておるんだろー！　儂はここじゃー！！", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "なっ……！？", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "霊体ランス", "text": "カオス！　でかした！\nがはははははっ！　ランス様参上！！", "face": "la0f84dc30bec"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "まさか堂々と玉座の間を占拠しているとは……。", "face": "lfe3fe8d5cb21"}, {"name": "ミスリア", "text": "わぁ、意志を持った魔剣ですよ！\nまじまじ見たい、じっくり眺めたい……。", "face": "u846"}, {"name": "魔剣カオス", "text": "でへでへ、\nお嬢ちゃん後でゆっくり観察させてあげよう……。", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "志津香", "text": "……やめておいたほうがいいわよ？", "face": "u1759a1"}, {"name": "霊体ランス", "text": "さぁ魔神セーレ、そろそろ決着の時間だ。\n俺の身体を返してもらうぞ。", "face": "la0f84dc30bec"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "ほざけぇ！　全員残らず我が配下としてやろう！", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "志津香", "text": "たぶんまた、転移の魔術を使って\n強制的に撤退させてくるはずよ。\n王子たちも気をつけて。", "face": "u1759a1"}, {"name": "グリム", "text": "あいつの周りに、転移の魔力が渦巻いてますねー。\nたぶん受け止めようとすると\nその強制転移が発動するんじゃないかと。", "face": "u942"}, {"name": "サテラ", "text": "厄介なヤツだな……。\n受け止めずに全力で殴れ、ってことか？", "face": "u1760a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そういうことかと。それではグリムさん、\n次元の狭間への転送準備お願いします。\n我々はそれまでの時間を稼ぎますよ！", "face": "lfe3fe8d5cb21"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "くっ……身体が言うことを聞かぬ……。\n魔剣カオス、貴様が邪魔しているのか！？", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "魔剣カオス", "text": "えー、儂そんなことしてないしー？\n――大方、貴様とランスの肉体の相性が最悪なんじゃろ。", "face": "le2e11fea1f65"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "ふざけたことを……。\n仕切り直しだ、空間転移――ッ！！", "face": "l56c324708564"}, {"name": "サテラ", "text": "グリム、今だ！！", "face": "u1760a1"}, {"name": "グリム", "text": "はーい、でっきまっしたー。\n次元の狭間行き異界の門、おーぷんっ！！", "face": "u942"}, {"name": "魔神セーレ", "text": "なっ……人間ごときが、転移魔術だと――ッ！？", "face": "l56c324708564"}]}], "active": true}